================================================================================
2. CHANGES MADE BY DAP
================================================================================

Relative to a stock KNIME Analytics Platform 5.12.0 installation, the DAP
distribution:

  - adds the com.dap.engine 1.0.0 bundle (HTTP /v1 service, catalog, dialog
    schemas, jobs, sessions);
  - omits UI, CEF/Chromium, product, workbench editor/docs/search/coach,
    enterprise, server, cloud, JS and bundled-JRE bundles when the runtime is
    assembled by scripts/vendor-runtime.sh;
  - includes a generated runtime/knime/configuration/config.ini and
    bundles.info (absolute paths are generated for the installation root);
  - adds generated catalog/catalog.json, catalog/schemas/*.json and
    catalog/schema-report.json;
  - adds adapters/mcp/dap_mcp.py, documentation, build scripts and tests.

No KNIME source files are patched. No KNIME copyright notices are removed.

